1. [On-Kill Recovery] Fully Removed
On-Kill Recovery had little impact in game, but polluted Affixes.
It has therefore been fully removed from appearing.
Fine Affixes no longer roll On-Kill Recovery; existing Affixes are unchanged.
Divine Tower Divine Power no longer grants On-Kill Recovery.
Warrior Mastery   adjusted.
Hunter Mastery   adjusted.
Mercenary Mastery   adjusted.

