<div data-panel="{&quot;clickOnActivate&quot;:&quot;firstChild&quot;}" role="button" class="forum_topic  unread sticky" id="forum_General_45898382_571549822592609785"  data-gidforumtopic="571549822592609785" data-tooltip-forum="			&lt;div class=&quot;topic_hover_text&quot;&gt;
				 

1. [Exploration] Level Cap Increased
As late-game combat power rises, Exploration rewards at level 20 have become somewhat lacking.
Exploration gains 4 more levels; max level is now 24, with richer rewards.

2.   Stages Expanded
To support new building upgrades, Astral Essence drops were insufficient.
Outlands gains 3 more stages; 12 stages in total.

